    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Just 200 metres from the village square, this modern cottage offers the perfect blend of contemporary comfort and a peaceful rural setting. Take in uninterrupted views across Carlingford Lough towards Rostrevor and Warrenpoint, creating a truly exceptional backdrop.\n\nThe heart of the home is the impressive open-plan kitchen/dining area, offering an excellent space for everyday family living and entertaining. Large windows and patio doors allow natural light to flood the room while providing easy access to the outdoor space. The ground floor also features two generous bedrooms including the master bedroom with ensuite, a separate shower room, utility room, and additional storage.\n\nUpstairs the property offers two further bedrooms, a modern family bathroom and a spacious landing. An additional feature of this home is the fully finished attic, providing a versatile additional room that is ideal for storage.\n\nExtending to approximately 105 sq. metres, the property is ideally located to enjoy everything Carlingford has to offer, including sailing, golf, hillwalking, and a wide range of outdoor activities. The village is also renowned for its award-winning restaurants, traditional pubs, and vibrant atmosphere.\n\nProperties in such a sought-after location rarely stay on the market for long.\nArrange your viewing today this exceptional home is sure to attract strong interest.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Notice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Negotiator",
        "SortOrder": 10,
        "Content": "Sarah McArdle"
      }
